Fix building CPython 2.7.8 with modern toolchains (C23 libm, OpenSSL 3, ncurses 6).

This is the CPython that the Pyston tests compare against; see tools/setup_deps.sh.
The same changes are applied to the copies of these files in from_cpython/.

