@@ -1609,6 +1622,7 @@ Returns 1 if the OpenSSL PRNG has been seeded with enough data and 0 if not.\n\
 It is necessary to seed the PRNG with RAND_add() on some platforms before\n\
 using the ssl() function.");
 
